cell — isolated environments for AI agent CLIs (claude, kimi, any other).
A blueprint is an agent identity: runtime + provider + model + persona.
'cell run NAME' starts it in the current folder with its own private config
dir (.<runtime>-env-NAME/): own login, sessions and settings.

Config: ~/.config/cell/config.toml (override with $CELL_HOME)"""

EPILOG = """
every day (in a project folder):
  cell max                     # start blueprint 'max' here (= cell run max)
  cell max -c                  # continue the last session
  cell max -r                  # pick a session to resume (-r ID opens that one)
  cell sessions                # sessions in this folder with titles; type a number to open
